lete Paths Divided MAP\" \"Hosted by @Cocolee38\" \"Enjoy!\" Rainpaw is on the side looking distressed and tired. P.S. The intro music is on the bottom of sounds, sorry for the inconvenience :')\n1 & 2: Sparklepaw is lip-syncing and singing to Rainpaw who looks akward \n3: Shows the night sky which has a lot of stars and is glittering. Sparklepaw 's paw is wiping across the screen \n4: Sparklepaw is lip-syncing and singing to Rainpaw who looks akward. At the end, the 'camera' cuts to Wavepaw who has an amused expression\n5: Wavepaw laughs and says \"You want me, I want you baby\" Then it changes to Sparklepaw who looks mad and says the rest of the lyrics for this part \n6: Wavepaw and Sparklepaw are both lipsyncing and they are pestering Rainpaw. \n7 & 8: Sparklepaw lip-syncs to this part, she looks a bit mad and is flustered.\n9: Wavepaw lip-syncs to this part, she looks a bit amused and finds this fun.\n10: Wavepaw walks around Rainpaw who is blushing really hard. \n11: Wavpaw is lip-syncing and singing to Rainpaw who looks a bit happy but still blushing. At \"I see us written in the stars\", It shifts to show the night sky and wavepaw's paw swipes across the glittering constellation of two cats.\n12: Wavpaw is lip-syncing and singing to Rainpaw who looks a bit happy but still blushing. \n13: Shows the night sky which has a lot of stars and is glittering. Show a glittering eye (Wavepaws) that binks. You may also show Rainpaw's eye too\n14:  Wavpaw is lip-syncing and singing to Rainpaw who looks a bit happy but still blushing. On the last line, show Wavepaw \nholding a small version of Mars.\n15: Wavepaw laughs and says \"You want me, I want you baby\" Then it changes to Sparklepaw who looks mad and says the rest of the lyrics for this part\n16: Wavepaw and Sparklepaw are both lipsyncing and they are pestering Rainpaw. \n17 & 18: Sparklepaw lip-syncs to this part, she is flirty and playing with Rainpaw's emotions.\n19 & 20: Wavepaw lip-syncs to this part, she looks a bit amused and finds this fun.\n21: Shifts to Rainpaw who is lip-syncing this part and looks happy, but a bit hesitant.\nOutro: Shows Rainpaw sitting in the middle with Sparklepaw on the left of him and Wavepaw on the right. They are staring at the stars and in the sky the words, \"Thank you for watching\" will appear."}},"currentCostume":1,"costumes":[{"name":"Wavepaw","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"729ead0c08507b69da646f7e104777c9","md5ext":"729ead0c08507b69da646f7e104777c9.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360},{"name":"Sparklepaw","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"69aa9e6846c444711a5da3f336ac83c3","md5ext":"69aa9e6846c444711a5da3f336ac83c3.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360},{"name":"Rainpaw","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"5411b487fe4d688732af518ecd0cb662","md5ext":"5411b487fe4d688732af518ecd0cb662.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360}],"sounds":[{"name":"1","assetId":"d740c3447ab935d03c8f4fc0a0414d73","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":218072,"md5ext":"d740c3447ab935d03c8f4fc0a0414d73.wav"},{"name":"2","assetId":"58b469aab56213bc2c8295a75baefa47","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":225314,"md5ext":"58b469aab56213bc2c8295a75baefa47.wav"},{"name":"3","assetId":"c9063e76908a6680dedbbc7e4830c790","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":223928,"md5ext":"c9063e76908a6680dedbbc7e4830c790.wav"},{"name":"4","assetId":"53dda86c7f292d94588ce343d9e730ac","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":215085,"md5ext":"53dda86c7f292d94588ce343d9e730ac.wav"},{"name":"5","assetId":"4ded11bcca1d454ac6a09a906b2e093c","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":253241,"md5ext":"4ded11bcca1d454ac6a09a906b2e093c.wav"},{"name":"6","assetId":"970681d6d6af34b222a843d119636526","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":48000,"sampleCount":183908,"md5ext":"970681d6d6af34b222a843d119636526.wav"},{"name":"7","a